DICAS DE USO DO TERMINAL:
Estilo da Fonte no terminal:
\e[0;32;40m
Fonte:
0-nenhum, 1-negrito, 4-sublinhado, 5-piscante, 7-reverso, 8-oculto
Cor da fonte:
30-preto, 31-vermelho, 32-verde, 33-amarelo, 34-azul, 35-magenta, 36-ciano, 37-branco
Cor do fundo:
40-preto, 41-vermelho, 42-verde, 43-amarelo, 44-azul, 45-magenta, 46-ciano, 47-branco.

Editar prompt do usuário:
#micro .bashrc 
PS1='\e[0;32m\u@\h\e[0;37m:\e[0;34m\w\e[0;37m $ ' 
Editar prompt do root:
#micro .bashrc
PS1='\e[0;31m\u@\h\e[0;37m:\e[0;35m\w\e[0;37m # '

Comandos:
- chown: novodono arquivo
- chgrp: novogrupo arquivo
- ip addr show: ver ip
- unxz nomedoarquivo.xz: descompactar xz
- tar -xvzf arquivo.tar.gz
- tar -czvf meus_arquivos.tar.gz arquivo1.txt arquivo2.pdf imagem.jpg
- localectl status
- localectl set-keymap us-acentos
- localectl list-keymaps
- loadkeys us-acentos
- unzip archive.zip
- fc-list: ver as fontes instaladas
- df -h: ver discos
- find . -name *.txt : procurar pelo arquivo
- chmod +x arquivo : deixa o arquivo executável

Atalhos do sistema:
Ctrl+=  Aumenta o tamanho da fonte no term
Ctrl+- Diminui o tamanho da fonte do term
W+Space Abre o menu
W+Backspace toggle Maximiza 
W+\ Minimiza
W+q fecha 
Alt+Tab ver janelas abertas
W+g Google Chromium
W+Return Terminal 

CONFIGURAÇÃO DO SISTEMA LABWC E FOOT:

Configurar o labwc-environment:
#micro ~/.config/labwc/environment
XKB_DEFAULT_LAYOUT=us,br
XKB_DEFAULT_VARIANT=intl,abnt2
XKB_DEFAULT_MODELS=abnt,abnt2
XKB_DEFAULT_OPTIONS=grp:shift_caps_toggle
XCURSOR_THEME=Adwaita
XCURSOR_SIZE=24

Configurar o labwc-menu:
#micro ~/.config/labwc/menu.xml
<openbox_menu>
<menu id="client-menu">
<item label="Full Screen"><action name="ToggleFullscreen" /></item>
<separator />
<menu id="client-list-combined-menu" label="Running..." />
</menu>
<menu id="root-menu">
<item label="Google"><action name="Execute" command="google-chrome"/></item>
<item label="Terminal"><action name="Execute" command="foot"/></item>
<item label="Pavucontrol"><action name="Execute" command="pavucontrol"/></item>
<item label="Gimp"><action name="Execute" command="gimp"/></item>
<item label="OBS"><action name="Execute" command="obs"/></item>
<item label="Exit"><action name="Exit"/></item>
</menu>
</openbox_menu>

Configurar o labwc-rc:
#micro ~/.config/labwc/rc.xml
<labwc_config>
<theme><name>Clia</name><cornerRadius>1</cornerRadius><font name="IBM Plex Mono" size="12" /></theme>
<keyboard>
<default />
<keybind key="W-Return"><action name="Execute" command="foot"/></keybind>
<keybind key="W-g"><action name="Execute" command="google-chrome"/></keybind>
<keybind key="W-p"><action name="Execute" command="pavucontrol"/></keybind>
<keybind key="W-Space"><action name="ShowMenu" menu="root-menu"/></keybind>
<keybind key="W-Backspace"><action name="Togglemaximize"/></keybind>
<keybind key="W-\"><action name="Iconify"/></keybind>
<keybind key="W-f"><action name="ToggleFullscreen"/></keybind>
<keybind key="W-q"><action name="Close"/></keybind>
</keyboard>
<mouse>
<default />
<context name="Root">
<mousebind button="Right" action="Press"><action name="ShowMenu" menu="root-menu"/></mousebind>
</context>
</mouse>
<windowSwitcher show="yes" preview="yes" outlines="no" allWorkspaces="no">
<fields>
<field content="desktop_entry_name" width="80%" />
<field content="state" width="10%" />
<field content="type_short" width="10%"/>
</fields>
</windowSwitcher>
</labwc_config>

Configurar o foot:
#mkdir ~/.config/foot
#cp /etc/xdg/foot/foot.ini ~/.config/foot/foot.ini
#micro ~/.config/foot/foot.ini
font=IBM Plex Mono:size=12
initial-window-mode=maximized
